# Used when this repo is handed to a docker build as a named context, which
# readym-gameserver/scripts/build-hosted-images.ps1 does for the hosted server images. Without it
# the context is over 400 MB of build output and git history for a source-only compile.

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vs
.vscode
.idea

**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/publish
**/TestResults
**/*.pdb

# Packaged mod folders and archives produced by BuildSdk.ps1.
Output

**/packages
**/*.nupkg
**/.nuget

# The core SDK is passed as its own build context, on the path the gameserver's
# Directory.Build.props points CoreSdkRoot at. Shipping the nested copy too would put the same
# sources in the image twice.
readym-core-sdk

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
